<!-- 11. How it works: a real three-stop sequence -->
<section id="how" class="how" data-section="how" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="how-title">How it works<span class="hand">three stops to the road</span></h2>
    <div class="how-steps-wrap">
      <span class="how-line" aria-hidden="true"><span class="how-line-fill" data-how-line></span></span>
      <ol class="how-steps">
        <li class="how-step" data-how-step>
          <span class="how-num">1</span>
          <h3>Tell us your dates</h3>
          <p>Send your dates, group size and the places you'd like to see, on WhatsApp or by message.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="how-step" data-how-step>
          <span class="how-num">2</span>
          <h3>We plan the route</h3>
          <p>We agree the route and the price with you before you arrive, and can book hotels along the way if you want.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="how-step" data-how-step>
          <span class="how-num">3</span>
          <h3>We meet you at the airport</h3>
          <p>Your driver-guide meets you at arrivals, and you can change plans day by day.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="how-tailor ruled">
      <div>
        <p class="hand">tailor-made</p>
        <p class="big">None of the five routes quite right?</p>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-prose">Tell us what you'd like to see and how many days you have, and we'll plan a route around it.</p>
      </div>
      {{#if quoteUrl}}<a href="{{quoteUrl}}" class="btn-ink">Plan a tailor-made tour →</a>{{/if}}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
